        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic puzzle where attention, logic, and speed work as a team. Each level is a new challenge: find your way out of tangled mazes, collect the necessary elements, search for hidden details, move objects, and match the right colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built on constant variety: sometimes a quick reaction test, sometimes a thoughtful task where strategy matters. No repetitions here—each level reveals an unusual format and requires finding a solution where it seems impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Levels for attentiveness, reaction, and logic <br>🧩 Combination of genres: from puzzles to dynamic mini-games <br>🌟 Bright and diverse visual design <br>⏳ Short rounds that easily draw you in <br>🔑 Simple mechanics, but engaging from the first minutes</p>",
